Material from others is not covered by this notice. It stays under its own terms:

- Map outlines: Natural Earth, 1:50m and 1:10m (public domain). naturalearthdata.com
- Flags: flagcdn.com, Flagpedia (public domain).
- City populations and positions: United Nations, Department of Economic and Social Affairs, Population Division,
  World Urbanization Prospects: The 2025 Revision, File 21. Licensed under CC BY 3.0 IGO.
  population.un.org/wup
- Country populations: World Bank, Population, total (SP.POP.TOTL), 2024. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  data.worldbank.org/indicator/SP.POP.TOTL
- How hard each country and capital is to find: derived from the slepemapy.cz Adaptive Geography Practice data
  sets (Papoušek, Pelánek and Stanislav, Masaryk University), which are made available under the Open Database
  License (ODbL) 1.0. The derived file data/slepemapy.json is offered under the same license.
  opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0
- How well known each location is: page-view statistics of English Wikipedia, Wikimedia Foundation.
- Memory model: FSRS version 5 with its published default weights (the open-spaced-repetition project).
- Typefaces: Barlow Condensed and B612, loaded from Google Fonts under their own open licenses.
